  {
    id: 75024701
    name: 刮骨銀塵
    skill_group_id: 750247
    level: 1
    type: 1
    skill_priority: 10
    cd_type: 1
    cd_time: 450
    start_cd_time: 180
    trigger_type: 1
    trigger_target: 1
    target_select_ai: 3
    action_id: 8311
    description:
      '''
      被動:每間隔5秒降低當前敵方傷害/射速/迴避/命中最高的單位對應屬性3%/3%/15%/15%,持續3秒。
